      "writtenOn": "2025-10-13T17:38:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Or do you mean UniformManager\u0027s fStartingOffset isn\u0027t being set until `rewindTo`?\n\nIn that case, that detail shouldn\u0027t leak up to users of PipelineDataGatherer. `endPaintData()` should mark the UniformManager\u0027s starting offset some how as well (I think it\u0027d be fine to happen in finish as well).",
      "parentUuid": "6d833dfd_ee3479e9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 178,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 178,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "469c58b8c69777278c44e9adc824bda3d4de2c89",
